  - Name: Meteor Pendant
    Description: "A crude pendant holding a genuine, unrefined piece of crater clay.
      It was given to the miners as a token of good fortune \u2014 not only to extract
      the usual material, but to one day draw closer to the very secret of the universe."
    ShortDescription: A crude pendant holding a genuine, unrefined piece of crater
      clay.
