  - Name: Miner's Suit
    Description: "An old yet durable outfit, consisting of a full-body suit sealed
      with a sturdy front zipper. It is designed to protect the body from the cuts
      of meteoritic minerals, known for their jagged and razor-sharp surfaces. In
      these lands, Clay is the only true source of wealth \u2014 and extracting it
      is the most profitable work, though also among the harshest and most exhausting."
    ShortDescription: An old yet durable outfit, consisting of a full-body suit sealed
      with a sturdy front zipper.
    GamePlayDescription: +1 DEF
